**ES Command Center**

Project Documentation & Reference

*Freeman Exhibitor Services  |  Version 6.33  |  May 9, 2026*

*Working Document — All decisions are permanent record*

# 1.  Project Overview

The ES Command Center is a web-based leadership dashboard built for Freeman Exhibitor Services leaders. It surfaces real-time operational intelligence, compliance deadlines, and actionable workspaces for each of the 9 Leader Resource responsibility areas.

**Live URL:**

- https://cwgaibler.github.io/ES_Command_Center/

**GitHub Repo:**

- https://github.com/CWGaibler/ES_Command_Center

**PAT:**

- [redacted — stored separately]

