# 3.  Freeman Brand Standards

## Colors

| **Variable** | **Hex** | **Usage** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| --fb | #001F5F | Freeman Blue / navy — primary color, headings, strong emphasis |
| --mb | #00BDF6 | Medium Blue — accents, job numbers, links, active states |
| --green | #42BB37 | Success states, completion indicators, positive deltas |
| --gold | #FFB500 | Warning states, in-progress indicators, active timeline dots |
| --orange | #FB471F | Error states, negative deltas, custom staffing flag |
| --surface | #F5F6FA | Page background |
| --white | #ffffff | Card backgrounds |
| --border | #E2E5EF | Card and component borders (1px) |
| --border-lt | #ECEEF5 | Light dividers inside cards |
| --muted | #7A8099 | Secondary text, labels, metadata |
| --fb-lt | #EBF0FA | Light navy tint — role total backgrounds, subtle fills |
| --fb-xlt | #F4F6FC | Extra light navy — hover states in dropdowns |

## Typography

- Font family: Nunito Sans throughout

- Body text: 14px / font-weight 700

- Meta / secondary text: 13.5px / font-weight 700

- Page titles: 21.6px / font-weight 800

- Large stat values (KPIs, revenue tiles): font-weight 900

- Section dividers: 12px / font-weight 900 / uppercase / letter-spacing 0.09em

## Component Standards

- Cards: white background, 1px solid #E2E5EF, 10px border-radius

- Chips (.chip): 14px, font-weight 700, 999px border-radius, 1.5px border

- Modal pattern: .lc-modal-overlay, top-anchored padding-top 80px, 500px wide, 10px radius, pill buttons 999px

- Page headers: .page-hdr with .page-title (21.6px/800) and .page-sub (14px/muted)

- Section dividers: ::after rule draws 1px line extending to right edge

