# 23.  Technical Reference

## Key Functions

| **Function** | **Purpose** |
| --- | --- |
| showPage(id, el) | Navigate to page, call page init function, reset stale workspace state |
| onScopeChanged() | Re-render the active page when scope pill changes |
| resetWorkspaceState() | Clear stale selections before page transition |
| getScopeShows() | Return show list matching the active scope pill |
| lcScopeFilter(rec) | Filter LC records (Recruiting/OB/TR/OFF) by active scope |
| canView(h) | Recruiting — determine ownership + stat tile visibility for identity h |
| canViewInScope(h) | Recruiting — determine sidebar visibility for identity h |
| getKpiScopeValue(kpi) | Return KPI value appropriate for current scope |
| goToShow(showId) | Route to Events Lens — rerouted from Staffing in v6.31 |
| goToEventLens(showId) | Navigate to Events Lens page and render the specified show |
| goToSsFromEvents(showId) | Navigate from Events Lens back to Staffing & Scheduling for this show |
| elRenderShow() | Render full Events Lens show profile from elSelId |
| elSearchInput(val) | Live search handler — filters all 705 shows by name or job number |
| elSelectShow(id) | Select a show from the search dropdown and render it |
| initEvents() | Initialize Events Lens page on navigation |
| elFmtDate(d) | Format ISO date string to "Mon DD" display format |
| elInitials(name) | Extract initials from a full name for avatar display |
| ssCalcRec(show) | Derive 5-category staffing model recommendation from show data |
| renderSsList() | Render Staffing & Scheduling sidebar show list |
| renderSsDetail() | Render Staffing detail panel for the selected show |
| renderActiveEvents() | Render Active Events panel on Today's Priorities |
| renderNeedsAttention() | Render dynamic Needs Attention panel from all LC data sources |
| initRecruiting() | Initialize Recruiting workspace |
| renderList() | Render Recruiting sidebar list |
| renderDetail() | Render Recruiting detail panel |

